{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T20:02:42.438Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"b9e4cf9ce07ea8638f2c8986","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-fyg1hl","claim:pm-gh1767","release:pm-pta8um"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-fyg1hl+pm-gh1767","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-fyg1hl","claim:pm-gh1767","release:pm-pta8um"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T20:02:42.438Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-22T20:02:42.438Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence (2026-11-22).\n\nrunWithConfigurationOnlySettings now wraps its policy layer in a settled flag that is set in a finally block, and the layer's predicate reads that flag before the caller's own predicate. A continuation that captured the scope's async context and runs after the callback returned or threw therefore reads the tracker normally. An enclosing scope that is still running keeps protecting the same root, so a settled inner layer does not release an outer preview.\n\nSpecs. The settings store spec captures a read inside the scope, releases it after the scope returned and after it threw, and sees the file-backed status both times; it also proves an outer live layer still applies after an inner one settled. A new SDK spec installs an extension whose activation defers a schema field read, runs a host preview, and sees the file-backed field only after the preview settled, while the read made during activation still sees none. Both specs fail with the fix reverted (the deferred read returned an empty field list).\n\nCallers checked: the CLI structured preview, the SDK transaction context, the settings dry run and the telemetry flush all await their work inside the callback, so none relied on the layer outliving it.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"8ddeaab4fa66191fddd7645f25b4da2ee4bcb15f78bb0ba316677fc36181132a","after_hash":"59e54c4bbe1253495b6b5e5b3ce840b030419464c51553176d0f6168c4a7d31f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8cdc982fe239056ad8cdbae73622867e89a004b7c102d708b15e079e9e5c65ac"}
